# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# Redirect non-www → www (permanent 301)
# GSC is registered with https://www.lusthub.web.id as canonical domain.
# All canonical URLs in code use https://www.lusthub.web.id.
# This ensures any non-www traffic is normalized to www.
# NOTE: Primary redirect is handled by Cloudflare Redirect Rule at edge.
# This file is a fallback (only active on Cloudflare Pages deployments).
https://lusthub.web.id/* https://www.lusthub.web.id/:splat 301
